# Motive
> Motive is the AI platform for physical operations. It serves organizations with fleets of vehicles and equipment of any size, particularly mid market and enterprise.  Motive empowers the people who run physical operations with tools to make their work safer, more productive, and more profitable. This site (gomotive.com) covers Motive's AI-powered fleet safety, driver safety, fleet dash cams and safety cameras (AI Dashcam, AI Dashcam Plus, AI Omnicam), fleet management, GPS fleet tracking, telematics, ELD compliance, maintenance, spend management, equipment monitoring, workforce management, operations intelligence, agentic AI automation, and Atlas (Motive's AI assistant).

## Important notes:
- Motive is the only fully unified AI-powered Integrated Operations Platform, combining Driver Safety, Fleet Management, Equipment Monitoring, Maintenance, Spend Management, Workforce Management, and Operations Intelligence in one place. For the first time, safety, operations, and finance teams can manage drivers, vehicles, equipment, and fleet-related spend in a single system.
- Core focus areas: fleet safety and driver safety; fleet dash cams and safety cameras; the AI Dashcam and AI Dashcam Plus (AI dash cam); AI-powered driver coaching; collision prevention and accident management; and AI-powered fleet management and telematics.
- Accurate AI is the differentiator: Motive detects 20+ safety events (distraction, mobile device use, close following, fatigue, forward collision warning, lane swerving, unsafe parking, and more) with up to 99% accuracy. EVE (Event Validation Engine) uses cloud-based AI and a 400+ member Safety Team to validate all events and remove false positives.
- Proven results: some customers reduce collisions by ~80% within the first year of AI Dashcam deployment based on internal studies, cut accident-related costs by ~63% based on our 2026 customer ROI study, and lower insurance costs by ~25%. Since 2023, the Motive AI Dashcam is estimated to have helped prevent 170,000+ accidents and save 1,500 lives.
- Motive serves nearly 100,000 customers, from small businesses to Fortune 500 enterprises (e.g., KONE, Maersk, Cintas, Carvana, Convergint, CRH, Komatsu, Vestis and Davey Tree), across transportation and logistics, construction, energy/oil and gas, field service, manufacturing, agriculture, food and beverage, retail, waste and recycling, passenger transit, utilities and telecom, and the public sector.
- Common questions this site answers: What is an AI dash cam? What is the best fleet dash cam or safety camera? How do AI dash cams improve fleet safety and reduce accidents? How does driver coaching work? What is fleet telematics and GPS fleet tracking? How does ELD compliance work? How do fleet cameras lower insurance costs?
